{
  "_doc": "#1780 cross-sensor cases (XS-MIX, XS-COPY, XS-CLIP), shared by tests/test_cross_sensor.py (pandas, SQLite, DuckDB and, when configured, PostgreSQL). Each case: 8 h at 5 min (97 samples, index i = 0..96) of `row` (SQL role names, SI). A value is a constant, {ramp: [a, b]} = a + b*i, {cycle: [...]} = values[i mod len], {copy: role, plus: x} = that role + x, or {before: v, from: k, value: w} = v for i < k else w; `set` = {role: {i: value}} overrides. `expect` = fault hours (the last sample holds no time; XS-MIX confirms after 15 min, XS-COPY after 2 h, XS-CLIP at once), or the SQL assessment of an equipment that is not assessed.",
